# --- mindmaps: brainstorming, before any of it is an idea --------------------
#
# The terminal half of the surface. `show` prints the tree, `add` grows it, and
# `promote` graduates a branch — the same three moves the canvas offers, for when
# you are already in a shell.
cmd_mindmap() {
