       takomo mindmap promote ID NODE --to epic|initiative
       takomo mindmap rm ID

A mindmap is a tree you grow at conversation speed, before any of it is an idea.
A node is a sentence or two; when a branch turns out to matter, promote it."
  shift
  case "$sub" in
    new)          cmd_mindmap_new "$@" ;;
    ls|list)      cmd_mindmap_ls "$@" ;;
    show)         cmd_mindmap_show "$@" ;;
    add)          cmd_mindmap_add "$@" ;;
    promote)      cmd_mindmap_promote "$@" ;;
    rm|delete)    cmd_mindmap_rm "$@" ;;
    *) die "mindmap: unknown subcommand '$sub' (new|ls|show|add|promote|rm)" ;;
  esac
}

